WEBVTT

00:07:28.027 --> 00:07:30.196
to which you can ask whatever you want,

00:07:30.237 --> 00:07:31.447
whatever you need?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.200
For example, taking notes in a meeting

00:07:34.241 --> 00:07:36.368
or reordering milk

00:07:36.368 --> 00:07:38.454
or even mental health coaching.

00:07:40.289 --> 00:07:43.334
Will they be able
to provide you recommendations

00:07:43.334 --> 00:07:45.794
across product categories?

00:07:46.212 --> 00:07:47.421
Today,

00:07:47.463 --> 00:07:52.009
companies provide us recommendations
within one specific category,

00:07:52.009 --> 00:07:55.804
for example, that can help us choose
between two dresses,

00:07:55.804 --> 00:07:57.389
between two books.

00:07:57.932 --> 00:08:02.311
In the future, the smart assistants
will actually be able to help us choose